  `<h2>The Mentor’s card</h2><p class="small">${own?`The Mentor looks at a card in secret and picks one Knowledge to teach, here “${esc(ex)}”. For a pair, either half counts as a correct answer.`:'Another card the Mentor might draw. Generations 1 and 2 use pairs; later generations use single, more abstract ideas.'}</p>
  <div class="panel" style="margin:8px 0"><p class="small muted" style="margin:0 0 6px">${c.x?'Expansion card '+String(c.no).slice(1):'Card '+c.no}, Generation ${c.era}</p><div class="knowledge">${c.items.map((x,s)=>`<div class="kitem${own&&s===0?' sel':''}"><span>${esc(x)}</span><span class="ic">${icons(suggest(s,x))}</span></div>`).join('')}</div></div>
  <p class="small muted" style="margin:0 0 4px">Dots show what each Knowledge develops:</p><div class="chips small" style="gap:10px">${legend}</div>
